 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "30-31 under a night sky: no fire motif for «نارا», nothing for «مدخلا كريما» (Paradise), only light for «نكفر عنكم سيئاتكم». No motif on the forbidden wish (32:1-9). Wheat for earning, a house for parents and relatives, a seal for the oath of alliance. 33: the two tafsirs differ on «موالي» and «فآتوهم نصيبهم» (heirs and an abrogated alliance share vs. allies owed support), so neither phrase is glossed; only the shared meanings of «الأقربون» and «عقدت أيمانكم» are. STAGING v4: 30-31 stay ambient: the Fire and Paradise. 32-33: a family (men and a woman, faceless) sits at home; the forbidden wish is not acted; the tafsirs differ on what is earned in 32:10-17 (reward or earnings), so no work or trade is drawn; they raise their hands on 32:18 (asking Him of His bounty, both tafsirs), hands plate ended before the Name. 33: the family speaks on 33:3 (heirs); house plate for parents and relatives, seal for the sworn alliance; the share of 33:11-12 (read differently) is not acted."
 },
